                  "from": 7.44,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2876890,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You will hear a manager in a company talking to employees about volunteering for charity work.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 16.485,
                  "from": 9.84,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2876907,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 16.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 22.485,
                  "from": 18.325,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2876917,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 16.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 72.305,
                  "from": 67.665,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2876927,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Thanks for coming, everyone. Okay. So this meeting is for new staff and staff who haven't been involved with our volunteering projects yet. So, basically, the idea is that we allow staff to give up some of their work time to help on various charity projects to benefit the local community. We've been doing this for the last five years, and it's been very successful.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2876928,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Thanks for coming, everyone.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 77.380005,
                  "from": 75.54,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2876933,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Okay.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 78.420006,
                  "from": 77.94,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2876935,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So this meeting is for new staff and staff who haven't been involved with our volunteering projects yet.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 85.22,
                  "from": 78.420006,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2876954,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So, basically, the idea is that we allow staff to give up some of their work time to help on various charity projects to benefit the local community.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 95.674995,
                  "from": 85.700005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2876983,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We've been doing this for the last five years, and it's been very successful.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 100.395,
                  "from": 96.475,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2876998,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Participating doesn't necessarily involve a huge time commitment. The company will pay for eight hours of your time. That can be used over one or two days all at once or spread over several months throughout the year. There are some staff who enjoy volunteering so much, they also give up their own free time for a couple of hours every week. It's completely up to you.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2876999,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Participating doesn't necessarily involve a huge time commitment.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 105.89,
                  "from": 101.649994,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877008,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The company will pay for eight hours of your time.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 109.329994,
                  "from": 106.13,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877019,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "That can be used over one or two days all at once or spread over several months throughout the year.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 117.255,
                  "from": 109.729996,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877040,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are some staff who enjoy volunteering so much, they also give up their own free time for a couple of hours every week.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 125.895,
                  "from": 118.05499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877065,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's completely up to you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 127.895,
                  "from": 126.215,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2877071,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Obviously, many people will have family commitments and aren't as available as other members of staff. Feedback from staff has been overwhelmingly positive. Because they felt they were doing something really useful, nearly everyone agreed that volunteering made them feel more motivated at work. They also liked building relationships with the people in the local community, and felt valued by them. One or two people also said it was a good thing to have on their CVs.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2877072,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Obviously, many people will have family commitments and aren't as available as other members of staff.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 135.36002,
                  "from": 128.88,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877089,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Feedback from staff has been overwhelmingly positive.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 139.68001,
                  "from": 136.8,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877097,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Because they felt they were doing something really useful, nearly everyone agreed that volunteering made them feel more motivated at work.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 148.895,
                  "from": 140.41501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877119,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They also liked building relationships with the people in the local community, and felt valued by them.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 155.6,
                  "from": 149.455,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877136,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "One or two people also said it was a good thing to have on their CVs.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 160.72002,
                  "from": 156.08,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2877153,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "One particularly successful project last year was the Get Working project. This was aimed at helping unemployed people in the area get back to work. Our staff were able to help them improve their telephone skills, such as writing down messages and speaking with confidence to potential customers, which they had found quite difficult. This is something many employers look for in job applicants, and something we all do without even thinking about every day at work. We've got an exciting new project starting this year.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2877154,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "One particularly successful project last year was the Get Working project.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 167.44,
                  "from": 162.24,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877166,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This was aimed at helping unemployed people in the area get back to work.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 172.80501,
                  "from": 168.565,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877181,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Our staff were able to help them improve their telephone skills, such as writing down messages and speaking with confidence to potential customers, which they had found quite difficult.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 185.53001,
                  "from": 173.445,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877211,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This is something many employers look for in job applicants, and something we all do without even thinking about every day at work.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 194.57,
                  "from": 186.25,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877235,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We've got an exciting new project starting this year.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 199.205,
                  "from": 196.325,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2877245,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Up until now, we've mainly focused on projects to do with education and training, and we'll continue with our reading project in schools and our work with local charities. But we've also agreed to help out on a conservation project in Redfern Park. So if any of you fancy being outside and getting your hands dirty, this is the project for you. I also wanted to mention the annual digital inclusion day, which is coming up next month. The aim of this is to help older people keep up with technology.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2877246,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Up until now, we've mainly focused on projects to do with education and training, and we'll continue with our reading project in schools and our work with local charities.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 209.88,
                  "from": 199.525,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877276,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But we've also agreed to help out on a conservation project in Redfern Park.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 216.28001,
                  "from": 210.52,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877291,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So if any of you fancy being outside and getting your hands dirty, this is the project for you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 222.44,
                  "from": 216.6,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877311,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I also wanted to mention the annual digital inclusion day, which is coming up next month.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 229.455,
                  "from": 223.855,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877328,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The aim of this is to help older people keep up with technology.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 233.93501,
                  "from": 230.015,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2877342,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "And this year, instead of hosting the event in our own training facility, we're using the ICT suite at Hill College as it can hold far more people. We've invited over 60 people from the Silver Age Community Center to take part, so we'll need a lot of volunteers to help with this event. If you're interested in taking part, please go to the volunteering section of our website and complete the relevant form. We won't be providing any training for this, but you'll be paired with an experienced volunteer if you've never done it before. By the way, don't forget to tell your manager about any volunteering activities you decide to do.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2877343,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And this year, instead of hosting the event in our own training facility, we're using the ICT suite at Hill College as it can hold far more people.",
                "meta": {
