          },
          {
            "id": 2877488,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The participants on the digital inclusion day really benefited. The majority were in their seventies, though some were younger, and a few were even in their nineties. Quite a few owned both a computer and a mobile phone, but these tended to be outdated models. They generally knew how to do simple things like send texts but weren't aware of recent developments in mobile phone technology. A few were keen to learn, but most were quite dismissive at first.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2877489,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The participants on the digital inclusion day really benefited.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 317.37,
                  "from": 313.53,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877499,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The majority were in their seventies, though some were younger, and a few were even in their nineties.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 323.53,
                  "from": 317.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877518,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Quite a few owned both a computer and a mobile phone, but these tended to be outdated models.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 330.275,
                  "from": 324.09,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877537,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They generally knew how to do simple things like send texts but weren't aware of recent developments in mobile phone technology.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 339.395,
                  "from": 330.755,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877559,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "A few were keen to learn, but most were quite dismissive at first.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 344.6,
                  "from": 340.36002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2877573,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "They couldn't see the point of updating their skills. But that soon changed. The feedback was very positive. The really encouraging thing was that participants all said they felt much more confident about using social media to keep in touch with their grandchildren, who prefer this form of communication to phoning or sending emails. A lot of them also said playing online games would help them make new friends and keep their brains active.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2877574,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They couldn't see the point of updating their skills.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 347.4,
                  "from": 344.84,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877584,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But that soon changed.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 349.32,
                  "from": 347.96,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877589,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The feedback was very positive.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 352.2,
                  "from": 349.96,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877595,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The really encouraging thing was that participants all said they felt much more confident about using social media to keep in touch with their grandchildren, who prefer this form of communication to phoning or sending emails.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 365.98502,
                  "from": 352.44,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2877632,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "A lot of them also said playing online games would help them make new friends and keep their brains active.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 373.36,
                  "from": 366.96,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2877653,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "They weren't that impressed with being able to order their groceries online as they liked going out to the shops, but some said it would come in handy if they were ill or the weather was really bad. One thing they asked about was using tablets for things like reading newspapers. Some people had been given tablets as presents but had never used them. So that's something we'll make sure we include this time.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2877654,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They weren't that impressed with being able to order their groceries online as they liked going out to the shops, but some said it would come in handy if they were ill or the weather was really bad.",
                "meta": {
